      <div class="rd-row-part">
        <span class="rd-part-k">The counter-case</span>
        <p>The same thinness applies, from the same cause: the matched set is drawn from a small number of real episodes rather than from that many independent ones, and it contains no instance of the floor giving way. A holder whose reason for raising cash is a bill, a deadline or a tolerance limit is answering a different question entirely &mdash; one about their own circumstances, which the historical record has no view on and this page never sees.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="rd-row-part">
